<title>ITALY: Italy July wholesale prices rose 2.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Italy July wholesale prices rose 2.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>National statistics office ISTAT gave the following Italian wholesale price data for July.</p>
<p> WHOLESALE PRICES	 July 96     June 96    July 95</p>
<p> Year/Year change	    +2.6%	+2.4%     +11.5%</p>
<p> Month/Month change	  -0.4%	-0.4%	-0.7%</p>
<p> Index (100 in 1990)	133.3	133.9	129.9</p>
</text>
